WEBVTT

00:04:59.333 --> 00:05:01.308
Derren Brown: Which one?
Jessica: Jessica.

00:05:01.322 --> 00:05:04.434
DB: Thank you. Just a guess.
Little murmur of approval, thank you?

00:05:04.458 --> 00:05:06.059
(Laughter)

00:05:06.083 --> 00:05:07.333
I'll take it.

00:05:08.583 --> 00:05:10.559
Alright, so Jessica,
I won't ask your age,

00:05:10.583 --> 00:05:12.934
but is it a question
essentially about the future?

00:05:12.958 --> 00:05:14.226
Jessica: Mhm?
DB: Yes?

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:15.518
Jessica: Yes.
DB: Yes. OK.

00:05:15.542 --> 00:05:20.518
Alright. So what did we ask?
What did Jessica ask about the future?

00:05:20.542 --> 00:05:24.976
So am I OK with late-30s, early-40s?

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.809
Jessica: I'll take it. I'm taking it.

00:05:26.833 --> 00:05:29.125
(Laughter)